275	        }
276	
277	        // FIXME
278	        // Toolbox may has dataZoom injected. And if there are stacked bar chart
279	        // with NaN data, NaN will be filtered and stack will be wrong.
280	        // So we need to force the mode to be set empty.
281	        // In fect, it is not a big deal that do not support filterMode-'filter'
282	        // when using toolbox#dataZoom, utill tooltip#dataZoom support "single axis
283	        // selection" some day, which might need "adapt to data extent on the
